                                   "name":  "Dynamic Tabs",
                                   "cms":  "aem",
                                   "summary":  "A tabbed content component featuring a multifield-based authoring interface for managing tab titles and rich-text content, with full WAI-ARIA accessibility support and keyboard navigation."
